What you'll bring&#xa0; 
 Bring your ability to independently evaluate industry trends, map complex business processes to solution requirements, advise on disruptive business innovation, lead change management efforts, and implement end-to-end solution-designed processes and technological configurations.&#xa0;
 What you'll build&#xa0; 
 You will independently evaluate industry and technology trends to introduce leading practices, map business processes to solution requirements utilising existing solution capabilities, support strategic and transition planning to align with business objectives, advise on disruptive business innovation and handle change management efforts, and implement end-to-end solution-designed processes and configure technological solutions. The role works with organisations to drive transformative change by translating customer visions into viable solutions and advancing industry-leading practices.&#xa0;
 Where you belong&#xa0; 
 At SAP, you will be part of an inclusive, global community of business process consulting professionals dedicated to driving transformative change and delivering outstanding customer outcomes. Together, we foster a culture where process expertise, strategic thinking, and innovation combine to translate customer visions into viable solutions that advance industry-leading practices.&#xa0;
 We value the skills you bring and support you to build on them through our learning and development opportunities. These are the skills associated with this role:&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;
 Data Governance · Data Modeling · AI data analytics&#xa0; · Data Storytelling· Data Engineering · Data Architecture · Business Process Modeling · Customer Value Proposition · Design Thinking · Effective Communication · AI-Workforce Transformation Planning · Context Engineering · AI Output Quality Assurance · Agentic AI Day-to-Day Practice · AI-Assisted Automation and Prototyping · AI Adoption Capability&#xa0;  About SAP

With a global network of customers, partners, employees, and thought leaders, SAP helps the world run better and improves people’s lives.

As a leader in enterprise applications and business AI, SAP stands at the nexus of business and technology. For over 50 years, organizations have trusted SAP to bring out their best by uniting business-critical operations spanning finance, procurement, HR, supply chain, and customer experience.

